        "title": "难道 + proposition + 吗",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "难道…吗 challenges an assumption through a rhetorical question. The speaker normally expects rejection of the questioned claim, not neutral information.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "难道你不知道吗？",
                "pinyin": "nándào nǐ bù zhīdào ma ？",
                "meaning": "Surely you know, do you not?",
                "audio": "b588235f2fc41a984eede4560047801af64037181878637ac78140fce0d9ac7a"
              },
              {
                "text": "难道我说错了吗？",
                "pinyin": "nándào wǒ shuō cuò le ma ？",
                "meaning": "Could I really have said something wrong?",
                "audio": "2fc982b8d040fd102bc614125ca5e208ec8391b474bef107e464b65052106110"
